ass=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span></span></a> this_id <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">get_id</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_osyncstream\"><span class=\"kw2666\">std::<span class=\"me2\">osyncstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"thread \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> this_id <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" sleeping...<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2169\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>500ms<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/jthread\"><span class=\"kw3257\">std::<span class=\"me2\">jthread</span></span></a> t1<span class=\"br0\">{</span>foo<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/jthread\"><span class=\"kw3257\">std::<span class=\"me2\">jthread</span></span></a> t2<span class=\"br0\">{</span>foo<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>thread 140113018054400 sleeping...\nthread 140113009661696 sleeping...</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div cl